>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. QA51B-FAULT-CONTROL.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 CTRL-ARMED PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 CTRL-TRIPPED PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 CTRL-TARGET PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
01 CTRL-TRIGGER PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 CTRL-SEEN PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 CTRL-FAIL-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-CMD PIC X(8).
01 LK-TARGET PIC X(16).
01 LK-COUNT PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-FAIL-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-TRIP PIC 9 COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
    LK-CMD LK-TARGET LK-COUNT LK-FAIL-STATUS LK-TRIP.
MAIN.
    MOVE 0 TO LK-TRIP
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(LK-CMD)
        WHEN "RESET"
            MOVE 0 TO CTRL-ARMED CTRL-TRIPPED
            MOVE 0 TO CTRL-TRIGGER CTRL-SEEN
            MOVE 0 TO CTRL-FAIL-STATUS
            MOVE SPACES TO CTRL-TARGET
            MOVE 0 TO LK-COUNT LK-FAIL-STATUS
        WHEN "ARM"
            IF LK-COUNT < 1 OR LK-FAIL-STATUS = 0
                MOVE 1 TO LK-TRIP
                MOVE 99 TO LK-FAIL-STATUS
            ELSE
                MOVE 1 TO CTRL-ARMED
                MOVE 0 TO CTRL-TRIPPED CTRL-SEEN
                MOVE LK-TARGET TO CTRL-TARGET
                MOVE LK-COUNT TO CTRL-TRIGGER
                MOVE LK-FAIL-STATUS TO CTRL-FAIL-STATUS
            END-IF
        WHEN "CHECK"
            IF CTRL-ARMED = 1 AND LK-TARGET = CTRL-TARGET
                ADD 1 TO CTRL-SEEN
                IF CTRL-SEEN = CTRL-TRIGGER
                    MOVE CTRL-FAIL-STATUS TO LK-FAIL-STATUS
                    MOVE 1 TO LK-TRIP CTRL-TRIPPED
                    MOVE 0 TO CTRL-ARMED
                END-IF
            END-IF
        WHEN "READ"
            MOVE CTRL-SEEN TO LK-COUNT
            MOVE CTRL-FAIL-STATUS TO LK-FAIL-STATUS
            MOVE CTRL-TRIPPED TO LK-TRIP
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 1 TO LK-TRIP
            MOVE 99 TO LK-FAIL-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM QA51B-FAULT-CONTROL.
